1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,875
Why do some people pull everyone in,

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,662
while others push everyone away?

3
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:05,925
Robert Greene says it comes down to one

4
00:00:05,938 --> 00:00:07,662
thing: where your focus points.

5
00:00:08,088 --> 00:00:10,338
The anti-seducer is trapped in their own head.

6
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:11,275
Do I look good?

7
00:00:11,688 --> 00:00:12,800
Did I say something stupid?

8
00:00:13,212 --> 00:00:15,525
That insecurity is something people can feel.

9
00:00:15,938 --> 00:00:18,025
The master seducer turns that voice off.

10
00:00:18,438 --> 00:00:20,012
They absorb you like a sponge,

11
00:00:20,338 --> 00:00:21,925
and listen for what is missing in your

12
00:00:21,938 --> 00:00:22,350
life.

13
00:00:22,762 --> 00:00:25,038
Errol Flynn made people feel like they'd had

14
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:25,950
two martinis.

15
00:00:26,362 --> 00:00:27,150
And the real weapon?

16
00:00:27,562 --> 00:00:28,388
Not acting tough.

17
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,512
Vulnerability.

18
00:00:29,938 --> 00:00:32,263
The full animated breakdown is on my channel.

19
00:00:32,688 --> 00:00:33,250
Subscribe.
